e: Will uses his boxing skills for intense one-on-one fights, the Viking smashes crowds with his hammer, and the Aztec strikes with deadly accuracy using his boomerang. Each encounter requires using all the characters' skills, but some foes are so powerf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/de3881a0d463f16dec402fe6ea1ddb5d.poster.avif?t=1749305341\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/de3881a0d463f16dec402fe6ea1ddb5d.webm?t=1749305341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/de3881a0d463f16dec402fe6ea1ddb5d.mp4?t=1749305341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Perspectives</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From graffiti-covered streets and crime-ridden alleys in Will\u2019s hometown to the snow-capped Viking mountains and the mystical Aztec catacombs. These worlds are more than reflections of reality: each has its own history, characters, conflicts, and mysteries. Only by following the Viking and Aztec can Will learn the truth about himself. But there's always a risk \u2014 he may lose himself in the visions and never return. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/b3c112cc6f65774564a465f14800ac4e.poster.avif?t=1749305341\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/b3c112cc6f65774564a465f14800ac4e.webm?t=1749305341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/b3c112cc6f65774564a465f14800ac4e.mp4?t=1749305341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Interaction</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle arenas in each hero\u2019s world allow the player to interact with their surroundings differently. In the Viking\u2019s world, you can throw or push objects, while in the Aztec\u2019s world, you can use height or distance to your advantage. Combining the environment\u2019s features gives you the upper hand in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/879367f6e105d6501b00d70057d897f3.poster.avif?t=1749305341\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/879367f6e105d6501b00d70057d897f3.webm?t=1749305341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/879367f6e105d6501b00d70057d897f3.mp4?t=1749305341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Puzzles</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Will\u2019s journey as he investigates the mystery of the Spark, diving into Viking and Aztec flashbacks to solve local puzzles and unlock new abilities for each character. Master their skills and discover the best combinations for progressing through the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/5824b9831f5e4b12c9b852d49b06fa4f.poster.avif?t=1749305341\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565010/extras/5824b9831f5e4b12c9b852d49b06fa4f.webm?t=1749305341\" type=\"video/webm; code